  "explanation": [
    "The Pythagorean identity is $\\sin^2\\theta + \\cos^2\\theta = 1$.",
    "Subtracting $\\cos^2\\theta$ from both sides gives $\\sin^2\\theta = 1 - \\cos^2\\theta$.",
    "So the expression simplifies to $\\sin^2\\theta$ — note that the square stays, so it is not just $\\sin\\theta$."
  ],
